 "meta": {
  "id": "6c354decae4d5b12ae9527041c5c86b1",
  "name": {
   "zh": "2D 抠像与分割",
   "en": "2D Matte and Segmentation"
  },
  "intro": {
   "zh": "先选一次物体：写要选的东西（留空 = 人），SAM 3 找出来后在视图里点选要的那几个（不点 = 全部）。这一个遮罩就是下面每个抠像模型的引导：MatAnyone 2 从它第一张有物体的帧往后抠满整段，SDMatte 逐帧精修出软边（SAM 3 软边），VideoMaMa 逐帧抠；AlphaGen 不用遮罩，直接从画面生成 alpha。每个抠像默认再做边缘前景色（去掉边缘的背景色与溢色），多交付一层预乘前景。另可勾自动分割（运动物体、全景类别、人体部位）。开着的每个结果交付一层，统一进一个多层 EXR，也可每层另存。",
   "en": "Select once: type what to select (empty = person), then pick the objects in the viewport once SAM 3 has found them (none = all). That mask guides every matte: MatAnyone 2 carries it through the shot, SDMatte refines a soft edge per frame (SAM 3 Soft Edge), VideoMaMa mattes per frame; AlphaGen needs no mask and generates the alpha from the picture. Edge foreground color is on by default (premultiplied, spill removed). Each result that is on is one layer of a multi-layer EXR."
  },
  "author": "Lab2Shot",
  "created": "2026-10-04T12:00:00",
  "updated": "2026-10-04T12:00:00",
  "deliverable": "workflow",
  "owner": "admin"
 },
